The PNG files here are glyphs from that font (fill 1, optical size 48, weight 500), drawn in #F2C14E for the newsletter. One family is used for every category and section mark.

missile.png is the rocket_launch glyph with the exhaust puff and the porthole removed, so it reads as a solid projectile.
nuclear.png is a geometric radiation trefoil (the public hazard symbol), drawn to the same optical size. It is not a second icon family.
